{"unit_id":"YNM10086__deepseek-mcp-plugin#card-zh","repo":"YNM10086/deepseek-mcp-plugin","commit":"8cb84e4591cd9165ae963973e14e409858862d83","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"deepseek-vision 是面向 DSH web 客户端的图片理解插件。它通过宿主级 bundle 挂载 vision_describe 工具，并提供可供其他插件调用的 vision 服务。用户可传入本地图片路径和问题，询问图片中的文字、物体、人数或海报内容；工具可按默认顺序调用 MiniMax、智谱，再降级到本地 Ollama，也能指定后端和单次请求超时。适合需要在 DSH 会话中对本地图片进行问答的用户。云端后端需要在固定配置文件中提供相应 API key；本地模式需要运行 Ollama。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:121-178","lib/index.js:187-209"]}
{"unit_id":"YNM10086__deepseek-mcp-plugin#card-en","repo":"YNM10086/deepseek-mcp-plugin","commit":"8cb84e4591cd9165ae963973e14e409858862d83","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"deepseek-vision adds image Q&A to DSH web. Its host bundle registers vision_describe and a reusable vision service. Give it an image path and question; it tries MiniMax, Zhipu, then Ollama, or uses a chosen backend. Cloud use needs an API key in the config file; local mode needs Ollama.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:121-178","lib/index.js:187-209"]}
