{"unit_id":"YNM10086__deepseek-mcp-plugin#feature-image-question","repo":"YNM10086/deepseek-mcp-plugin","commit":"8cb84e4591cd9165ae963973e14e409858862d83","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"deepseek-vision 的功能「图片问答」：用户调用 vision_describe 并提供本地图片绝对路径和问题，工具调用所选视觉后端并返回文字答案及后端和耗时信息。触发方式为 DSH 工具调用。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:121-178"]}
{"unit_id":"YNM10086__deepseek-mcp-plugin#feature-fallback","repo":"YNM10086/deepseek-mcp-plugin","commit":"8cb84e4591cd9165ae963973e14e409858862d83","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"deepseek-vision 的功能「视觉后端自动降级」：vision_describe 默认依次尝试 MiniMax、智谱和本地 Ollama；网络错误、服务端错误或限流时可以继续尝试后续后端，输出最终回答。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:84-115","lib/index.js:187-204"]}
{"unit_id":"YNM10086__deepseek-mcp-plugin#feature-local-mode","repo":"YNM10086/deepseek-mcp-plugin","commit":"8cb84e4591cd9165ae963973e14e409858862d83","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"deepseek-vision 的功能「本地 Ollama 处理」：用户可将 backend 设为 ollama，让图片问题交给本机 Ollama API；也可设置模型名称和 API 地址。输入是图片路径与问题，输出为模型文字回答。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:56-58","lib/index.js:71-74","lib/index.js:187-204"]}
{"unit_id":"YNM10086__deepseek-mcp-plugin#feature-vision-service","repo":"YNM10086/deepseek-mcp-plugin","commit":"8cb84e4591cd9165ae963973e14e409858862d83","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"deepseek-vision 的功能「可复用视觉服务」：插件通过 vision 名称提供 describe 服务，其他插件可取得该服务并提交图片路径、问题及后端选项，获得回答、使用后端和延迟信息。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:121-178"]}
{"unit_id":"YNM10086__deepseek-mcp-plugin#caveat-privacy","repo":"YNM10086/deepseek-mcp-plugin","commit":"8cb84e4591cd9165ae963973e14e409858862d83","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"deepseek-vision 使用默认云端后端时会把图片和问题发送到 MiniMax 或智谱 API；选择 Ollama 才会请求本机服务。云端需要对应 API key，路径和请求逻辑见源码。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:71-93"]}
